OL,3,GNEWSAWoman too scared to jog after
OL,4,Athrown firework hits her neck
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum says she is too scared to go
OL,7,Fjogging alone again after being hit in
OL,8,Fthe neck when a firework and an egg
OL,9,Fwere thrown from a passing car.
OL,11,FCharlotte Wilde, 41, from Hartlebury,
OL,12,Fin Worcestershire, said she initially
OL,13,Ffelt something hit her before being
OL,14,Fsurrounded by sparks and hearing a loud
OL,15,Fbang at her feet.
OL,17,FThe incident happened as she ran along
OL,18,FFranche Road in Kidderminster at about
OL,19,F19:45 GMT on Bonfire Night. "I just
OL,20,Ffeel really vulnerable," the
OL,21,Fmum-of-three said, adding: "I'm just
OL,22,Fscared someone's going to do it again."
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
